स योगी ब्रह्मनिर्वाणं ब्रह्मभूतोऽधिगच्छति ॥ २४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1712,\"bb\":1513,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/24/b1513/\",\"body_value\":\"yo ’ntaḥ-sukho ’ntar-ārāmas
tathāntar-jyotir eva yaḥ
sa yogī brahma-nirvāṇaṁ
brahma-bhūto ’dhigacchati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1713,\"bb\":1514,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/24/b1514/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yaḥ – one who; antaḥ-sukhaḥ – happy from within; antaḥ-ārāmaḥ – actively enjoying within; tathā – as well as; antaḥ-jyotiḥ – aiming within; eva – certainly; yaḥ – anyone; saḥ – he; yogī – a mystic; brahma-nirvāṇam – liberation in the Supreme; brahma-bhūtaḥ – being self-realized; adhigacchati – attains.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"one who\"},{\"word\":\"antaḥ-sukhaḥ\",\"translation\":\"happy from within\"},{\"word\":\"antaḥ-ārāmaḥ\",\"translation\":\"actively enjoying within\"},{\"word\":\"tathā\",\"translation\":\"as well as\"},{\"word\":\"antaḥ-jyotiḥ\",\"translation\":\"aiming within\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"anyone\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"yogī\",\"translation\":\"a mystic\"},{\"word\":\"brahma-nirvāṇam\",\"translation\":\"liberation in the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"brahma-bhūtaḥ\",\"translation\":\"being self-realized\"},{\"word\":\"adhigacchati\",\"translation\":\"attains\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1714,\"bb\":1515,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/24/b1515/\",\"body_value\":\"One whose happiness is within, who is active and rejoices within, and whose aim is inward is actually the perfect mystic. He is liberated in the Supreme, and ultimately he attains the Supreme.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1715,\"bb\":1516,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/24/b1516/\",\"body_value\":\"Unless one is able to relish happiness from within, how can one retire from th